{"seq":2,"slug":"embedded-linux-yocto","title":"嵌入式 Linux 与 Yocto","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/applications/embedded-linux-yocto","wordCount":677,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"嵌入式-linux-与-yocto\">嵌入式 Linux 与 Yocto</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>嵌入式 Linux 是将 Linux 操作系统裁剪并适配到资源受限硬件上的技术实践。与 MCU 上的 RTOS 不同，嵌入式 Linux 运行在具有 MMU 的处理器上（如 ARM Cortex-A 系列），提供完整的进程隔离、文件系统、网络协议栈和驱动模型。Yocto Project 是构建定制嵌入式 Linux 发行版的工业级框架，被 Intel、NXP、TI 等主要芯片厂商采用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[嵌入式 Linux 系统] --&gt; B[Bootloader]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Linux Kernel]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Root Filesystem]&#10;    B --&gt; E[U-Boot]&#10;    C --&gt; F[设备树 Device Tree]&#10;    C --&gt; G[内核模块]&#10;    D --&gt; H[BusyBox/systemd]&#10;    D --&gt; I[应用程序]&#10;    D --&gt; J[库 glibc/musl]&#10;    K[构建系统] --&gt; L[Yocto/BitBake]&#10;    K --&gt; M[Buildroot]\">graph TD\n    A[嵌入式 Linux 系统] --&gt; B[Bootloader]\n    A --&gt; C[Linux Kernel]\n    A --&gt; D[Root Filesystem]\n    B --&gt; E[U-Boot]\n    C --&gt; F[设备树 Device Tree]\n    C --&gt; G[内核模块]\n    D --&gt; H[BusyBox/systemd]\n    D --&gt; I[应用程序]\n    D --&gt; J[库 glibc/musl]\n    K[构建系统] --&gt; L[Yocto/BitBake]\n    K --&gt; M[Buildroot]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>RTOS (FreeRTOS)</th>\n<th>嵌入式 Linux</th>\n<th>桌面 Linux</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最小 RAM</td>\n<td>~1KB</td>\n<td>~8MB</td>\n<td>~256MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小存储</td>\n<td>~32KB</td>\n<td>~4MB</td>\n<td>~2GB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>启动时间</td>\n<td>μs-ms</td>\n<td>1-10s</td>\n<td>10-60s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进程隔离</td>\n<td>无（共享地址空间）</td>\n<td>完整（MMU）</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件系统</td>\n<td>无/简单</td>\n<td>ext4/squashfs</td>\n<td>ext4/btrfs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>驱动模型</td>\n<td>无标准</td>\n<td>Linux Driver Model</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用处理器</td>\n<td>Cortex-M, RISC-V MCU</td>\n<td>Cortex-A, RISC-V AP</td>\n<td>x86/ARM64</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"yocto-构建系统\">Yocto 构建系统</h2><p>Yocto 使用 BitBake 构建引擎和分层配方（Recipe）系统来生成完整的 Linux 镜像：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# Yocto 项目初始化&#10;git clone git://git.yoctoproject.org/poky&#10;cd poky&#10;git checkout scarthgap  # LTS 版本&#10;source oe-init-build-env&#10;&#10;# 配置目标硬件 (conf/local.conf)&#10;# MACHINE = &quot;raspberrypi4-64&quot;&#10;# DISTRO = &quot;poky&quot;&#10;# IMAGE_INSTALL:append = &quot; python3 nodejs mosquitto&quot;&#10;&#10;# 构建最小镜像&#10;bitbake core-image-minimal&#10;&#10;# 构建包含完整开发工具的镜像&#10;bitbake core-image-full-cmdline\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Yocto 项目初始化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> git://git.yoctoproject.org/poky</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> poky</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> scarthgap</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # LTS 版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">source</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> oe-init-build-env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 配置目标硬件 (conf/local.conf)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># MACHINE = \"raspberrypi4-64\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># DISTRO = \"poky\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># IMAGE_INSTALL:append = \" python3 nodejs mosquitto\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 构建最小镜像</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bitbake</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> core-image-minimal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 构建包含完整开发工具的镜像</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bitbake</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> core-image-full-cmdline</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Yocto 层（Layer）架构</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 层的组织结构&#10;meta-poky/          # Poky 参考发行版&#10;meta-openembedded/  # 社区软件包&#10;meta-raspberrypi/   # 树莓派 BSP&#10;meta-custom/        # 自定义应用层&#10;  ├── conf/&#10;  │   └── layer.conf&#10;  ├── recipes-core/&#10;  │   └── myapp/&#10;  │       ├── myapp_1.0.bb&#10;  │       └── files/&#10;  │           └── myapp.service&#10;  └── recipes-kernel/&#10;      └── linux/&#10;          └── linux-%.bbappend\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 层的组织结构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">meta-poky/</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # Poky 参考发行版</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">meta-openembedded/</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 社区软件包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">meta-raspberrypi/</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # 树莓派 BSP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">meta-custom/</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 自定义应用层</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  ├──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> conf/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  │</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">   └──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> layer.conf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  ├──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> recipes-core/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  │</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">   └──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  │</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">       ├──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp_1.0.bb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  │</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">       └──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> files/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  │</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">           └──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp.service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  └──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> recipes-kernel/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      └──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> linux/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">          └──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> linux-%.bbappend</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>配方（Recipe）示例</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# recipes-core/myapp/myapp_1.0.bb&#10;SUMMARY = &quot;My IoT Application&quot;&#10;LICENSE = &quot;MIT&quot;&#10;LIC_FILES_CHKSUM = &quot;file://LICENSE;md5=xxx&quot;&#10;&#10;SRC_URI = &quot;git://github.com/example/myapp.git;branch=main;protocol=https&quot;&#10;SRCREV = &quot;abc123&quot;&#10;S = &quot;${WORKDIR}/git&quot;&#10;&#10;inherit cmake systemd&#10;&#10;SYSTEMD_SERVICE:${PN} = &quot;myapp.service&quot;&#10;&#10;do_install:append() {&#10;    install -d ${D}${systemd_system_unitdir}&#10;    install -m 0644 ${WORKDIR}/myapp.service ${D}${systemd_system_unitdir}/&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># recipes-core/myapp/myapp_1.0.bb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SUMMARY</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"My IoT Application\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LICENSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"MIT\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LIC_FILES_CHKSUM</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"file://LICENSE;md5=xxx\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SRC_URI</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"git://github.com/example/myapp.git;branch=main;protocol=https\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SRCREV</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"abc123\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">S</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">WORKDIR</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}/git\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">inherit</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cmake</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> systemd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SYSTEMD_SERVICE:$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">{PN}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"myapp.service\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">do_install:append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ${D}${systemd_system_unitdir}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0644</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ${WORKDIR}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/myapp.service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ${D}${systemd_system_unitdir}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Yocto 概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>类比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Layer</td>\n<td>功能/硬件层</td>\n<td>软件包仓库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Recipe (.bb)</td>\n<td>构建一个软件包的指令</td>\n<td>Makefile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BitBake</td>\n<td>构建引擎</td>\n<td>make</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MACHINE</td>\n<td>目标硬件</td>\n<td>--target</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DISTRO</td>\n<td>发行版配置</td>\n<td>Ubuntu vs Fedora</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IMAGE</td>\n<td>最终镜像组成</td>\n<td>安装光盘</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"设备树与驱动\">设备树与驱动</h2><p>Linux 使用设备树（Device Tree）描述硬件拓扑，替代了早期的硬编码板级信息：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 设备树片段 (board.dts)&#10;/ {&#10;    model = &quot;Custom IoT Gateway&quot;;&#10;&#10;    leds {&#10;        compatible = &quot;gpio-leds&quot;;&#10;        status-led {&#10;            gpios = &lt;&amp;gpio1 5 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH&gt;;&#10;            label = &quot;status&quot;;&#10;            linux,default-trigger = &quot;heartbeat&quot;;&#10;        };&#10;    };&#10;};&#10;&#10;&amp;i2c1 {&#10;    status = &quot;okay&quot;;&#10;    clock-frequency = &lt;400000&gt;;&#10;&#10;    bme280@76 {&#10;        compatible = &quot;bosch,bme280&quot;;&#10;        reg = &lt;0x76&gt;;&#10;    };&#10;};&#10;&#10;&amp;spi0 {&#10;    status = &quot;okay&quot;;&#10;&#10;    spidev@0 {&#10;        compatible = &quot;spidev&quot;;&#10;        reg = &lt;0&gt;;&#10;        spi-max-frequency = &lt;10000000&gt;;&#10;    };&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 设备树片段 (board.dts)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Custom IoT Gateway\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    leds {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        compatible </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"gpio-leds\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">led {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            gpios </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gpio1 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E